fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266GeneralHRDParameters","fragment":"\n\tGstH266GeneralHRDParameters\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266GeneralHRDParameters\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266GeneralHRDParameters\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 HDR parameters.\nthe number of time units of a clock operating at the\nfrequency time_scale.\nnumber of time units that pass in one second.\nspecifies whether NAL HRD parameters\nare present in the general_timing_hrd_parameters syntax structure.\nspecifies whether VCL HRD parameters\nare present in the general_timing_hrd_parameters syntax structure.\nspecifies whether the\nnon-scalable-nested PT SEI message in each AU applies to the AU for any\nOLS in the bitstream and no scalable-nested PT SEI messages are present.\nspecifies whether DU level HRD\nparameters are present and the HRD could operate at the AU level or DU level.\nspecifies the clock sub-tick.\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate of the CPB.\nspecifies the CPB size of the CPB.\nspecifies the CPB size of the CPB at du level.\nplus 1 specifies the number of alternative CPB\ndelivery schedules.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 HDR parameters.\nthe number of time units of a clock operating at the\nfrequency time_scale.\nnumber of time units that pass in one second.\nspecifies whether NAL HRD parameters\nare present in the general_timing_hrd_parameters syntax structure.\nspecifies whether VCL HRD parameters\nare present in the general_timing_hrd_parameters syntax structure.\nspecifies whether the\nnon-scalable-nested PT SEI message in each AU applies to the AU for any\nOLS in the bitstream and no scalable-nested PT SEI messages are present.\nspecifies whether DU level HRD\nparameters are present and the HRD could operate at the AU level or DU level.\nspecifies the clock sub-tick.\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate of the CPB.\nspecifies the CPB size of the CPB.\nspecifies the CPB size of the CPB at du level.\nplus 1 specifies the number of alternative CPB\ndelivery schedules.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 HDR parameters.\nthe number of time units of a clock operating at the\nfrequency time_scale.\nnumber of time units that pass in one second.\nspecifies whether NAL HRD parameters\nare present in the general_timing_hrd_parameters syntax structure.\nspecifies whether VCL HRD parameters\nare present in the general_timing_hrd_parameters syntax structure.\nspecifies whether the\nnon-scalable-nested PT SEI message in each AU applies to the AU for any\nOLS in the bitstream and no scalable-nested PT SEI messages are present.\nspecifies whether DU level HRD\nparameters are present and the HRD could operate at the AU level or DU level.\nspecifies the clock sub-tick.\nspecifies the maximum input bit rate of the CPB.\nspecifies the CPB size of the CPB.\nspecifies the CPB size of the CPB at du level.\nplus 1 specifies the number of alternative CPB\ndelivery schedules.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});